- How would you scale window size and watermark strategy for 1000 partitions while preserving latency goals?

## Why This Is Asked
This question probes building a scalable, auditable per-tenant MV with cryptographic proofs, a gap between privacy-first aggregates and real-time access.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant materialized views and tenant isolation
- Incremental updates with watermarking
- Tenant-level encryption and access control tokens
- Merkle audit proofs for tamper-evidence
